---
schemaType: collection
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Templates
description: Policies, plans, registers and worksheets written for New Zealand law. Download, adapt, and use them. No attribution needed inside your own documents.
permalink: /templates/
---
{%- set headFacts -%}<div><dt>Templates</dt><dd>{{ collections.templates | length }}</dd></div><div><dt>Licence</dt><dd>CC BY 4.0, no attribution needed inside your own documents</dd></div><div><dt>Formats</dt><dd>Markdown, plus CSV for registers</dd></div>{%- endset -%}
{% include "partials/page-head.njk" %}
<section class="band" aria-labelledby="tpl-list">
  <div class="split">
    <div class="split-head">
      <h2 id="tpl-list">Adapt, don't copy</h2>
      <p>Each template explains why each section exists. If your organisation handles sensitive information at scale, have someone experienced review what you end up with.</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="rows">
    {% for t in collections.templates | byOrder %}
      <li><a class="row" href="{{ t.url }}"><span class="row-title">{{ t.data.title }}</span><span class="row-desc">{{ t.data.description }}</span></a></li>
    {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
